nation.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Select the retained prior-cycle WB value when neither EX/MEM nor current MEM/WB has the freshest operand.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 6, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/reg_file.sv\", \"description\": \"Remove same-cycle WB comparison and write-through muxing from both asynch\n…[5003 of 8075 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:3104aba4270dee5d]…\n top-level contract.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 108.63, \"delta_pct\": -3.83, \"vs_baseline\": 796.29, \"fmax_mhz\": 52.2, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4805217, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 2430, \"ff\": 612, \"seeds\": [49.244, 52.2, 52.2], \"perturbations\": [[0, 49.244, 14], [1, 52.2, 13], [2, 52.2, 13]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_ex/reg_q.rd_1_s0\", \"to\": \"dmem_0_dmem_0_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -15.307, \"arrival_ns\": 25.602, \"logic_cells\": 16, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_fwd\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 14, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T07:46:33.989079Z\", \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 12, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-01 hyp-20261001-002-r12s1 (regression, -3.83%): A synchronous register-file read adds a fetch/operand alignment boundary with startup, redirect, and stall coordination costs, and that overhead did not repay its hoped-for timing benefit on CoreMark.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
