arding unit and EX ALU to the data-memory address. Binary forwarding selection adds selector encoding and data-mux logic to this path.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Generate priority-correct one-hot hits for the register-file, EX/MEM, and MEM/WB operands, then combine masked operand values in EX with an OR. This removes the binary select decode between register-tag comparison and ALU input, which may shorten the critical forwarding-to-address path.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 7, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/forward_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Produce one-hot operand-source selects while preserving EX/MEM-over-MEM/WB priority and x0 behavior.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Replace the binary case forwarding muxes with one-hot masked-OR operand selection.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 7, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/forward_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Produce one-hot operand-source selects while preserving EX/MEM-over-MEM/WB priority and x0 behavior.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Replace the binary case forwarding muxes with one-hot masked-OR operand selection.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 12.48, \"delta_pct\": 2.97, \"vs_baseline\": 2.97, \"fmax_mhz\": 5.607, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4491485, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 12008, \"ff\": 460, \"seeds\": [5.355, 5.607, 5.607], \"perturbations\": [[0, 5.355, 149], [1, 5.607, 146], [2, 5.607, 146]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_ex/reg_q.rd_3_s0\", \"to\": \"dmem_0_dmem_0_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -181.742, \"arrival_ns\": 192.036, \"logic_cells\": 150, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_fwd\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 149, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T03:07:16.821062Z\", \"slot\": 0, \"round_id\": 1, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-01 hyp-20261001-001-r1s0 (regression, +2.97%): Explicit one-hot forwarding with 32-bit mask-and-OR operand logic regressed fitness, so removing binary select encoding alone did not offset the added datapath logic on this target.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
