al-branch BTB with registered one-fetch-ahead lookup and sequential refill after redirects.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Carry the registered fetch prediction metadata with its instruction into EX.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Train the BTB on resolved branches and correct fetch only when prediction differs from actual outcome or target.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.\n…[4264 of 7336 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:1e8ba6cbf0e9114e]…\nExpose resolved backward-branch training information and correct prediction mismatches.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Connect resolved branch training signals from EX to the IF predictor.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 100.22, \"delta_pct\": -6.85, \"vs_baseline\": 726.9, \"fmax_mhz\": 43.51, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4341510, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 2777, \"ff\": 702, \"seeds\": [43.887, 43.51, 43.51], \"perturbations\": [[0, 43.887, 20], [1, 43.51, 22], [2, 43.51, 22]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/id_ex_w.rs2_val_26_s1\", \"slack_ns\": -17.786, \"arrival_ns\": 28.08, \"logic_cells\": 29, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_divider\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_hazard\", \"cpu/u_id\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 20, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T05:50:25.399597Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 7}\na1886e3 bench fixture root\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
