egression, -24.60%): Operand-based ID branch resolution can trade EX redirect bubbles for a longer ID-to-fetch-PC path, since EX/MEM bypass muxes, branch comparison, and target generation now feed the redirect decision.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
