{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"sed -n '1,120p' cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261001-002-r11s1.yaml\"","aggregated_output":"id: hyp-20261001-002-r11s1\ntitle: \"Split the execute stage\"\ncategory: structural\nmotivation: |\n  The latest timing path still spans forwarding, execute and divider control, fetch, hazard logic, and decode. Several fetch-side retiming and prediction changes failed to improve fitness, while the recent divider-context change helped by isolating a long control dependency. Splitting the normal execute work at a pipeline boundary directly targets the remaining long combinational stage.\nhypothesis: |\n  Divide execute into an operand stage and a result stage. The first stage performs the existing forwarding selection and registers the selected operands together with the instruction metadata; the second stage performs ALU, branch, and target calculations and produces the memory-stage payload. Retain one-instruction-per-cycle throughput, update forwarding and hazard handling for the extra boundary, and preserve detached iterative DIV/REM execution and in-order retirement. The added register should separate operand selection from arithmetic and redirect logic, improving Fmax enough to outweigh the extra branch recovery cycle.\nexpected_impact:\n  fitness_delta_pct: 8\n  confidence: low\nchanges:\n  - file: rtl/core_pkg.sv\n    description: \"Add a registered execute-operand bundle carrying the forwarded operands and required instruction metadata.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Split operand forwarding from ALU, branch, and target execution with a pipeline register between the two stages.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Connect the new execute boundary while preserving divider launch/completion and the single-channel RVFI interface.\"\n  - file: rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n    description: \"Adjust stalls and flushes for the additional execute stage and preserve in-order behavior across memory waits and redirects.\"\n  - file: rtl/forward_unit.sv\n    description: \"Update producer-stage matching so forwarded operands remain correct across the split execute pipeline.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
