arry fetch prediction metadata through the ID/EX register to branch resolution.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compare prediction with actual branch outcome and redirect only on a mismatch while retaining architectural pc_next.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 6, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \n…[4292 of 7364 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:89d0957fac25b46d]…\n, \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 99.36, \"delta_pct\": -7.65, \"vs_baseline\": 719.8, \"fmax_mhz\": 42.354, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4262695, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 2981, \"ff\": 649, \"seeds\": [41.348, 42.354, 42.354], \"perturbations\": [[0, 41.348, 23], [1, 42.354, 23], [2, 42.354, 23]], \"lutram\": 30, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/id_ex_w.rs1_val_0_s100\", \"slack_ns\": -19.185, \"arrival_ns\": 29.48, \"logic_cells\": 46, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_hazard\", \"cpu/u_id\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 23, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T03:47:04.259752Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 2, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-01 hyp-20261001-003-r2s2 (regression, -7.65%): Even an 8-entry tagged BTB puts indexed tag/counter reads, tag comparison, and a 32-bit target mux on the IF PC update path, so lookup timing can outweigh saved EX redirect bubbles on this FPGA.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
